    "title": "Alice's Tile Story: Garden",
    "description": "Welcome to Alice's Tile Story: Garden Match, an addictive matching puzzle game! Are you ready to challenge your logic and strategy? In this game, you need to solve challenging puzzles by matching identical tiles.\r\n\r\nIn this game, you will encounter countless possibilities, and it's your unique problem-solving abilities that will help you overcome the challenges. Whether you want to pass the time or give your brain a workout, Alice's Tile Story: Garden Match is the perfect choice for you!\r\n\r\nNote that the game includes a cash withdrawal feature and Google is not a sponsor of the game.\r\nThe game is aimed at adults over the age of 16.",
